  "details": "The X sensitivity in this game is too high, while the Y sensitivity is too low. I would like to have the option to adjust these separately. Additionally, in the game VRC, mouse sensitivity is highly affected by FPS fluctuations; when FPS drops significantly, mouse sensitivity increases sharply, and when FPS is high, mouse sensitivity decreases noticeably. I would like mouse input to be unaffected by FPS changes.",
